{"id": "86266", "name": "נקודת מינימום של פולינום ממעלה שלישית (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the {{CT:0}}-value at which the function</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}, \\]</p><p>has its minimum.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>The function has a minimum at</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( x = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Find the turning points from \\(f'=0\\), then use the sign of the second derivative.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The turning points</b><br>To find the \\({{CT:1}}\\)-value at which the function \\(f({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}\\), has turning points, differentiate and find the values of \\({{CT:1}}\\) for which the differential is equal to 0.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{d{{CT:1}}}\\left({{CT:2}}\\right) &amp;=&amp; {{CT:3}} \\\\ {{CT:3}} &amp; =&amp; 0 \\\\ {{CT:4}}&amp;=&amp; 0 \\end{array} \\]</p>which factorises to give<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}}  \\mbox{ and }  {{CT:1}} = -10 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The second derivative test</b><br>A turning point is a minimum if \\(\\frac{d^2}{d{{CT:1}}^2}\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)\\)&gt;0.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{d^2}{d{{CT:1}}^2}\\left({{CT:2}}\\right) = {{CT:6}} \\]</p>This is positive for \\({{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}}\\) and negative for \\({{CT:1}} = -10\\). Therefore the minimum value of the function \\(f({{CT:1}})\\) occurs at \\({{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}}\\).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "diffdiffp", "diffp", "diffpsimp", "n1", "p", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 8}